1
00:00:05,532 --> 00:00:09,778
… as long as it is one
of the beneficial things.

2
00:00:11,548 --> 00:00:14,068
Part of what makes life
between spouses
beautiful is …

3
00:00:15,164 --> 00:00:20,156
that the husband,
when he sees in his wife
zeal for something good
and beneficial, …

4
00:00:20,156 --> 00:00:22,258
encourages her in it

5
00:00:23,388 --> 00:00:27,420
and shows her
that there is
benefit in it.

6
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:32,572
And if she goes
somewhat too far
in the matter, …

7
00:00:32,572 --> 00:00:35,452
he guides her
in a good manner.

8
00:00:35,452 --> 00:00:37,756
Likewise the wife:

9
00:00:37,756 --> 00:00:40,986
When she sees
in her husband
zeal for what is good

10
00:00:41,756 --> 00:00:44,402
and commitment
to what is good, …

11
00:00:45,212 --> 00:00:49,618
she shows him
her joy about it

12
00:00:50,588 --> 00:00:52,856
and encourages him
in this matter –

13
00:00:52,856 --> 00:00:54,610
so life
becomes beautiful.

14
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:59,996
And both spouses
work together,
with each of them …

15
00:00:59,996 --> 00:01:04,188
… taking the other
by the hand –
towards what benefits.

16
00:01:04,188 --> 00:01:05,215
This,
honoured audience, …
